text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLBackup","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlbackup","kind":"symbol","title":"MXLBackup","abstract":[{"text":"The backup and forward elements are required to coordinate multiple voices in one part, including music on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"multiple staves. The backup type is generally used to move between voices and staves. Thus the backup element","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"does not include voice or staff elements. Duration values should always be positive, and should not cross","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"measure boundaries or mid-measure changes in the divisions value.","type":"text"}]}}}